  "content": "\n\n# Dimension Link\n\n你是否有玩過 Bukkit 伺服器或其分支（如 Spigot 或 Paper）？你可以遊覽多個世界，每個世界都有獨立的地獄與終界維度，並能透過原版傳送門正常存取。你是否嘗試過透過數據包或模組新增維度來複製此功能，卻發現地獄或終界傳送門只能連接到原版維度？本模組即為解決此問題而開發。作為 Multiverse-NetherPortals 外掛的伺服器模組替代方案。\n\nDimension Link 可在不同維度之間建立傳送門連結，以創建自訂的世界組合，讓你終於能擁有專屬地獄與終界維度的資源維度。\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CLE9GIvNDn4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n## 功能特色\n\n- 建立專屬獨立地獄與終界傳送門的自訂世界組合。\n- 可自訂出口傳送門的行為。\n- 簡易設定與數據包支援。\n\n**可加入現有的整合包或世界，也能輕鬆從現有世界中移除。請務必先備份你的世界。**\n\n歡迎在 [GitHub 討論區](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/discussions) 或 [Discord](https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz) 提出關於維度連結的新功能建議。\n\n## 使用方法\n\n預設情況下，Dimension Link 會自動將各自命名空間中路徑為 \"overworld\"、\"the_nether\" 和 \"the_end\" 的維度進行連結。你也可以透過設定檔進行配置，或使用數據包進行資料驅動設定。\n\n<details>\n<summary>設定檔 (dimensionlink.json)</summary>\n\n你可以設定自動連結功能，或新增特定的自訂連結。\n\n```\n{\n    \"auto_link\": {\n        \"exact_overworld_path\": \"overworld\",\n        \"exact_the_nether_path\": \"the_nether\",\n        \"exact_the_end_path\": \"the_end\"\n    },\n    \"worlds\": [\n        {\n            \"overworld\": \"dimensionlink:overworld\",\n            \"the_nether\": \"dimensionlink:the_nether\",\n            \"the_end\": \"dimensionlink:the_end\",\n            \"disable_end_respawn\": true\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>數據包</summary>\n\n在你的數據包命名空間資料夾中，建立一個名為 \"dimensionlink\" 的資料夾，並在內部建立 \"world\" 資料夾。接著在 world 資料夾中建立任意名稱的 JSON 檔案，內容如下：\n\n```\n{\n    \"overworld\": \"test:one\",\n    \"the_nether\": \"test:two\",\n    \"the_end\": \"test:three\",\n    \"disable_end_respawn\": true\n}\n```\n-> data\\\\{namespace}\\dimensionlink\\world\\\\{anything}.json\n\n</details>\n\n通常終界中的終界傳送門（出口傳送門）會使玩家重生，但你可以透過世界設定檔或數據包將其改為具有傳送門功能。\n\n## 相容性\n\n- [Passengers Portal Fix](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **Create** 擴充模組：[Create: Portal Integration](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 問題回報\n\n目前沒有收到新的相容性問題或錯誤回報。如有發現問題，請至 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/issues) 回報以便修正。\n\n## 版本支援\n\n🟩 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 已支援  \n🟥 已停止支援  \n🟨 開發中  \n🟪 考量中  \n\n## 重要注意事項\n\n本模組僅改變傳送門的行為（例如變更目的地維度）。它無法建立自訂傳送門（如 [World Portal](https://modrinth.com/project/A2PZGios)），也無法建立或載入自訂維度，你需要使用數據包或其他模組來達成這些功能。這也表示本模組未包含讓進度系統、終界出口傳送門生成以及終界龍之戰能在鏡像維度上正常運作的修補程式（[Dimension Fixer](https://modrinth.com/project/hJmXo78w) 可解決此問題）。\n\n本模組旨在滿足個人遊戲玩法調試、伺服器自訂及整合包製作的需求。歡迎在任何整合包、影片、直播或類似媒體中使用。若你喜歡本模組，歡迎考慮提供財務支持，我會非常感激。\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"See me on GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Watch me on YouTube\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Chat with me on Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Saweria\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/hJmXo78w\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/A2PZGios\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Miqj0P3U\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/cs5vil9i\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create Portal Integration\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/8SpfTsnq\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/superflatdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Superflat Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Amplified Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Large Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Y3EdVfom\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/mushroomfieldsdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Mushroom Fields Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Desert Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HW5SOOxi\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-badlandsbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/badlandsbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Badlands Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/63pdCQ3Y\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/forestbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Forest Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/SrhObyPX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/thevoiddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"The Void Dimension\"></a>\n</p>",
